'''Queen Mother V''' (太古の蜜江, ''Taiko no Mitsue'', '''Mitsue the Ancient''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Queen B]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[I'll Be Bug (Merciless)|The Old Queen]]. She was added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Queen Mother V
|image = E 493.png
|appearance = [[I'll Be Bug (Merciless)|The Old Queen]]<br>
[[The Eldest Queen]]
|money drop = 6,666¢ - 26,330¢
}}

==Enemy==
The Relic variant of Queen B has very similar characteristics to her predecessor: Extremely high range and Long Distance attacks that inflict a status effect. While [[Curse]] may seem less threatening than [[Slow]], Queen Mother V is capable of cursing units for a whopping 111 seconds, crippling the defenses of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] tankers against the [[One Horn]]s and [[Professor A.|Professor As]] that appear in [[I'll Be Bug (Merciless)|I'll Be Bug]] and [[I'll Big Bug (Merciless)|I'll Big Bug]].

==Strategy==
:''See [[I'll Be Bug (Merciless)]], [[I'll Big Bug (Merciless)]] and [[Be Bee Queen (Merciless)]] for each stage's strategy.''

