==Trivia==
*Among the Tier 2 [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]], Queen Mother V appears to represent the virtue of patience, which includes peace and mercy - a requirement if she's to be beloved by her whole hive. Furthermore, patience is commonly associated with old age, which lines up with Queen Mother V being a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] over 888 years of age.
**She also has the longest curse duration of all units in the game, requiring great patience to outlast.
*Queen Mother V can be seen as a foil to her [[Queen B|original variant]]: Queen B is an exiled [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] princess, Queen Mother V a beloved Relic queen.
*Queen Mother V may be based on various green bee species such as the [[wikipedia:Euglossa dilemma|green orchid bee]], [[wikipedia:Xylocopa bombylans|peacock carpenter bee]], [[wikipedia:Augochlora pura|golden sweat bee]] or [[wikipedia:Agapostemon texanus|metallic green sweat bee]].
*Mitsue is a Japanese given name with many different spellings, such as 光絵, meaning "bright drawing". In this case, it's 蜜江, meaning "honey river" or "nectar river".
*Her 18,888 damage, 8 knockbacks, 888 minimum effective range and 888 years of performing arts experience are all based on a pun: the Japanese word for 8, 八 ''hachi'', sounds exactly like 蜂, meaning honeybee.
*Her curse duration of 3,333f may refer to how 三つ ''mittsu'' (three) sounds much like 蜜 ''mitsu'' (honey).
*Her Japanese description mentions ''[[wikipedia:Enka|enka]]'', a genre of music that stylistically resembles traditional Japanese music.
*Her Japanese description originally had a typo. It said 耐えない ''taenai'' (intolerable, unbearable) instead of 絶えない ''taenai'' (constant, unending).

